PDPCLIB upstream licence notice
==============================

The following notice is retained from the imported pdpclib.txt. Individual
source files retain their notices and contributor history. Original z-pdos
changes and integration files follow the repository MIT grant; that grant
does not alter these upstream terms.

The canonical upstream runtime changes merged on 1 October retain their
individual notices. The current pdpclib.txt also includes upstream's caution
about a later vsesupa.asm copyright question. That later VSE implementation
was not imported by this runtime merge; inspect each native file's notices
before a future port or source replacement.

Written by Paul Edwards.
Released to the public domain.
You may use this entire package for any purpose whatsoever without
restriction.

